    "answer": {
      "short": "Two teams: the Hawks and Cassowaries.",
      "worked": "Compare the winning teams’ percentages before and after round six, adding each match score to the appropriate cumulative total.\n\nHawks: $\\frac{130}{104}\\times100\\%=125\\%$ before; $\\frac{130+30}{104+28}\\times100\\%\\approx121.2\\%$ after.\n\nCassowaries: $\\frac{126}{90}\\times100\\%=140\\%$ before; $\\frac{126+31}{90+27}\\times100\\%\\approx134.2\\%$ after.\n\nBrolgas: $\\frac{105}{112}\\times100\\%=93.75\\%$ before; $\\frac{105+27}{112+16}\\times100\\%=103.125\\%$ after.\n\nEmus: $\\frac{77}{105}\\times100\\%\\approx73.3\\%$ before; $\\frac{77+20}{105+15}\\times100\\%\\approx80.8\\%$ after.\n\nOnly the Hawks and Cassowaries decreased: two teams.",
